<cell>The contour plots for four different surfaces are given in the figure. 
Select the contour diagram for the function <m>f(x,y)</m> that satisfies
the following conditions at the point P.
<ol>
<li>
<m>\displaystyle \frac{df}{dx}</m> is positive and <m>\displaystyle \frac{df}{dy}</m> is negative.
</li>
<li>
<m>\displaystyle \frac{df}{dx}</m> is positive and <m>\displaystyle \frac{df}{dy}</m> is positive.
</li>
<li>
<m>\displaystyle \frac{df}{dx}</m> is negative and <m>\displaystyle \frac{df}{dy}</m> is negative.
</li>
<li>
<m>\displaystyle \frac{df}{dx}</m> is negative and <m>\displaystyle \frac{df}{dy}</m> is positive.
</li>
</ol></cell>
